#: prefs.js:49
msgid "Nonlinear Animation"
msgstr "非线性动画"

#: prefs.js:55
msgid "Animation curve"
msgstr "动画曲线"

#: prefs.js:56
msgid ""
"Pick a curve and it applies instantly. Create your own, or share curves as "
"files."
msgstr "选一条曲线即可，立即生效。也可以自己画，或用文件分享曲线。"

#: prefs.js:60
#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:38
msgid "Apply custom curves"
msgstr "应用自定义曲线"

#: prefs.js:61
msgid ""
"Off: GNOME own curves play untouched; interruption continuity still applies. "
"The gallery is disabled while off."
msgstr "关闭时 GNOME 原生曲线原样播放，打断连续性依然生效；画廊随之停用。"

#: prefs.js:92
msgid "Speed"
msgstr "速度"

#: prefs.js:93
msgid ""
"How long eased animations take to play. Dragging right slows them down: 1.0 "
"= GNOME default, 1.8 ≈ macOS."
msgstr "缓动动画的播放时长。向右拖动更慢：1.0 = GNOME 默认，1.8 ≈ macOS 手感。"

#: prefs.js:95
msgid "Animation duration"
msgstr "动画时长"

#: prefs.js:103
msgid "Faster"
msgstr "快"

#: prefs.js:115
msgid "Slower"
msgstr "慢"

#: prefs.js:126
msgid "Motion"
msgstr "运动"

#: prefs.js:130
#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:65
msgid "Interruption continuity"
msgstr "打断连续性"

#: prefs.js:131
msgid ""
"Interrupted animations keep their momentum instead of restarting from "
"standstill (e.g. flipping two app-grid pages quickly)."
msgstr ""
"被打断的动画保留原有动量，不再从静止重新加速（例如应用网格连续快速翻两页）。"

#: prefs.js:137
#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:50
msgid "Reversal buffering"
msgstr "反向缓冲"

#: prefs.js:138
msgid ""
"Recommended on. An interruption into the opposite direction decelerates and "
"rebounds instead of changing direction instantly. Turning it off is only "
"meant for isolating unexpected behavior; you then get the native hard "
"reversal."
msgstr ""
"建议开启。被打断为相反方向时先减速回弹再折返，而不是瞬间变向。关闭仅用于隔离"
"意外问题，将回到原版的生硬反转。"

#: prefs.js:145
msgid "Reversal depth"
msgstr "反向缓冲深度"

#: prefs.js:152
msgid "Hard"
msgstr "生硬"

#: prefs.js:162
msgid "Bouncy"
msgstr "弹跳"

#: prefs.js:171
msgid "Workspace switching"
msgstr "工作区切换"

#: prefs.js:172
msgid ""
"Ease the workspace switch animation. Turn off if secondary monitors flicker "
"during switches on multi-monitor fractional-scale setups."
msgstr ""
"对工作区切换动画应用曲线。多显示器分数缩放环境下切换时若副屏闪烁，请关闭。"

#: prefs.js:179
msgid "Spring fidelity"
msgstr "弹簧求解精度"

#: prefs.js:180
msgid ""
"How spring curves are solved. Ultra integrates physics every frame: higher "
"fidelity, more CPU."
msgstr "弹簧曲线的求解方式。极致模式逐帧积分物理，保真更高，CPU 占用也更高。"

#: prefs.js:183
msgid "Efficient (analytic)"
msgstr "高效（解析解）"

#: prefs.js:184
msgid "Ultra (frame integration)"
msgstr "极致（逐帧积分）"

#: prefs.js:194
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行为"

#: prefs.js:201
msgid "Ease magic-lamp minimize"
msgstr "缓动 magic-lamp 最小化"

#: prefs.js:202
msgid ""
"If compiz-alike-magic-lamp-effect is installed, decelerate its minimize/"
"unminimize into the dock. No-op otherwise."
msgstr ""
"若安装了 compiz-alike-magic-lamp-effect，其最小化/还原动画会减速收尾。未安装"
"则无任何影响。"

#: prefs.js:211
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

#: prefs.js:212
msgid "Toggles for the deeper interventions, and rarely-touched tuning."
msgstr "较深层干预的开关，以及很少动的调节项。"

#: prefs.js:216
#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:116
msgid "Instant overview close"
msgstr "Overview 即时关闭"

#: prefs.js:217
msgid ""
"A close requested mid-animation reverses the overview immediately instead of "
"finishing its opening first. Turn off if overview open/close misbehaves."
msgstr ""
"动画进行中请求关闭时，立即反向收回，而不是先放完打开动画。若 overview 开合行"
"为异常请关闭。"

#: prefs.js:224
#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:80
msgid "Threshold (ms)"
msgstr "阈值（毫秒）"

#: prefs.js:225
msgid ""
"Only animations ≥ this get eased (hovers ~100ms). Lower = more things eased."
msgstr ""
"只有不低于该时长的动画才被缓动（悬停约 100ms）。调低 = 更多动画被缓动。"

#: prefs.js:232
msgid "Gesture grace (ms)"
msgstr "手势宽限（毫秒）"

#: prefs.js:233
msgid ""
"After a 3-finger swipe/pinch, animations play native for this long. 0 = ease "
"everything."
msgstr ""
"三指滑动/捏合之后的一段宽限时间内，动画按 GNOME 原生速度播放。0 = 全部缓动。"

#: prefs.js:240
#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:92
msgid "Gesture duration scale"
msgstr "手势时长倍数"

#: prefs.js:241
msgid ""
"Stretches gesture commits (workspace switch, paging). The curve stays "
"velocity-matched, so there is no jolt. 1.0 = native."
msgstr ""
"拉长手势收尾动画（工作区切换、翻页），曲线保持速度匹配所以不顿挫。1.0 = 原"
"生。"

#: prefs.js:308
msgid "New curve"
msgstr "新建曲线"

#: prefs.js:314
msgid "Import"
msgstr "导入"

#: prefs.js:320
msgid "Export"
msgstr "导出"

#: prefs.js:326 prefs.js:503
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "删除"

#: prefs.js:373
msgid "Library full"
msgstr "曲线库已满"

#: prefs.js:374 prefs.js:424
#, javascript-format
msgid "At most %d user curves can be stored."
msgstr "最多只能保存 %d 条自定义曲线。"

#: prefs.js:397
msgid "Import curves"
msgstr "导入曲线"

#: prefs.js:412 prefs.js:418 prefs.js:423
msgid "Import failed"
msgstr "导入失败"

#: prefs.js:412
msgid "Could not read the file."
msgstr "无法读取该文件。"

#: prefs.js:451
msgid "Export curve"
msgstr "导出曲线"

#: prefs.js:473
#, javascript-format
msgid "Delete “%s”?"
msgstr "删除“%s”？"

#: prefs.js:482
msgid "Nonlinear animation curves"
msgstr "非线性动画曲线"

#: prefs.js:493
msgid "OK"
msgstr "确定"

#: prefs.js:500
msgid "This cannot be undone."
msgstr "此操作无法撤销。"

#: prefs.js:502 ui/curve-editor.js:62
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

#: curves.js:31
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "均衡"

#: curves.js:32
msgid "Dramatic"
msgstr "夸张"

#: curves.js:33
msgid "Quick settle"
msgstr "快速收尾"

#: curves.js:34
msgid "Firm settle"
msgstr "坚定收尾"

#: curves.js:35

#: curves.js:36
msgid "Whip"
msgstr "疾停"

#: curves.js:37
msgid "Smooth"
msgstr "平顺"

#: curves.js:38

#: curves.js:39
msgid "Overshoot"
msgstr "回弹"

#: ui/curve-editor.js:64
msgid "Save"
msgstr "保存"

#: ui/curve-editor.js:76
msgid "Curve name"
msgstr "曲线名称"

#: ui/curve-editor.js:86
msgid ""
"Drag points to shape the curve. Double-click to add a point, right-click to "
"remove one."
msgstr "拖动控制点调整曲线形状。双击添加控制点，右键删除。"

#: ui/curve-editor.js:291
msgid "Give the curve a name first."
msgstr "请先给曲线起个名字。"

#: ui/curve-editor.js:319
msgid "A curve can have at most 24 points."
msgstr "一条曲线最多 24 个控制点。"

#: ui/curve-editor.js:323
msgid "Points must stay ordered left to right."
msgstr "控制点必须保持从左到右的顺序。"

#: ui/curve-editor.js:325
msgid "Keep points between -0.5 and 1.5 vertically."
msgstr "控制点的纵向位置需保持在 -0.5 到 1.5 之间。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:18
msgid "Easing curve (legacy)"
msgstr "缓动曲线（旧版）"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:19
msgid ""
"Legacy curve key from v1-v5. Still read once for migration to selected-"
"curve; otherwise unused."
msgstr ""
"v1-v5 的旧曲线键。仅在迁移到 selected-curve 时读取一次，其余情况不再使用。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:23
msgid "Settings schema version"
msgstr "设置架构版本"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:24
msgid ""
"Bumped automatically after the one-time migration from the legacy mode key."
msgstr "从旧版 mode 键完成一次性迁移后自动递增。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:28
msgid "Selected curve"
msgstr "当前曲线"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:29
msgid ""
"Id of the active curve: a built-in preset (preset:…) or a user curve "
"(user:…)."
msgstr "当前生效曲线的 ID：内置预设（preset:…）或自定义曲线（user:…）。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:33
msgid "User curves"
msgstr "自定义曲线"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:34
msgid "User-created and imported curves, one JSON object per entry."
msgstr "用户创建和导入的曲线，每条一个 JSON 对象。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:39
msgid ""
"Replace GNOME's easing curves with the selected curve. Off: GNOME's own "
"curves play untouched; interruption continuity still applies."
msgstr ""
"用选中的曲线替换 GNOME 的缓动曲线。关闭时 GNOME 原生曲线原样播放，打断连续性"
"仍然生效。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:44
msgid "Interruption momentum"
msgstr "打断动量"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:45
msgid ""
"Same-direction inertia: how much velocity carries over when the new "
"animation continues the old direction (e.g. flipping two app-grid pages "
"quickly). 0 = GNOME-like re-acceleration, 1 = balanced, 2 = exaggerated."
msgstr ""
"同向惯性：新动画延续原方向时速度保留多少（例如应用列表快速连翻两页）。0 = 原"
"版式重新加速，1 = 均衡，2 = 夸张。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:51
msgid ""
"Reversal inertia: the decelerate-and-rebound feel when an animation is "
"interrupted into the opposite direction (minimize right after starting a "
"restore). 0 = hard reversal, 1 = balanced bounce, 2 = deep elastic "
"compression."
msgstr ""
"反向惯性：动画被打断为相反方向时的减速回弹手感（例如恢复动画刚开始就最小"
"化）。0 = 生硬反转，1 = 均衡回弹，2 = 深度弹性压缩。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:55
msgid "Reversal buffering enabled"
msgstr "启用反向缓冲"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:56
msgid ""
"Master switch for the reversal bounce, independent of the same-direction "
"momentum. Off = interrupted reversals change direction immediately (native "
"behavior)."
msgstr ""
"反向回弹的总开关，独立于同向动量。关闭后打断的反向动画立即变向（原版行为）。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:60
msgid "Ease workspace switching"
msgstr "缓动工作区切换"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:61
msgid ""
"Apply the curve and duration to workspace switch animations. Turn off if "
"secondary monitors flicker during switches on multi-monitor fractional-scale "
"setups."
msgstr ""
"对工作区切换动画应用曲线和时长。多显示器分数缩放环境下切换时若副屏闪烁，请关"
"闭。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:66
msgid ""
"When an animation is interrupted (e.g. flipping two app-grid pages quickly), "
"carry the current velocity into the new animation instead of re-accelerating "
"from standstill, using a velocity-matched spring."
msgstr ""
"动画被打断时（例如应用网格连续快速翻两页），用带初速度的弹簧把当前速度带入新"
"动画，而不是从静止重新加速。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:74
msgid "Spring solver"
msgstr "弹簧求解器"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:75
msgid ""
"How spring curves are evaluated. analytic (default): closed-form solution, a "
"few math calls per frame. numeric: Ultra mode, per-frame physics integration "
"for maximum fidelity at a slightly higher CPU cost."
msgstr ""
"弹簧曲线的求值方式。analytic（默认）：闭式解析解，每帧只做几次数学运算。"
"numeric：极致模式，逐帧物理积分，保真度最高但 CPU 占用略高。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:81
msgid ""
"Only animations at or above this duration get the easing curve. Lower = more "
"things eased (hovers ~100ms); higher = fewer."
msgstr ""
"只有不低于该时长的动画才被缓动。调低 = 更多动画被缓动（悬停约 100ms）；调高 "
"= 更少。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:86
msgid "Duration scale"
msgstr "时长倍数"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:87
msgid ""
"Multiplier for the duration of eased animations. 1.0 = GNOME's default "
"(quick); 1.8 ≈ macOS; 2.5 = slow/luxurious."
msgstr ""
"缓动动画时长的倍数。1.0 = GNOME 默认（快）；1.8 ≈ macOS；2.5 = 缓慢从容。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:93
msgid ""
"Duration multiplier for animations during/after a touchpad gesture "
"(workspace switch, app-grid paging). The easing curve is kept at GNOME's "
"velocity-matched EASE_OUT_CUBIC so there's no jolt on release; this only "
"stretches the duration so the deceleration reads more. 1.0 = gestures fully "
"native."
msgstr ""
"触摸板手势期间/之后（工作区切换、应用网格翻页）动画时长的倍数。曲线保持 "
"GNOME 速度匹配的 EASE_OUT_CUBIC，松手不会顿挫；这里只拉长时长让减速段更明显。"
"1.0 = 手势完全原生。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:98
msgid "Touchpad gesture grace (ms)"
msgstr "触摸板手势宽限（毫秒）"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:99
msgid ""
"Window after a touchpad gesture (3-finger swipe/pinch) during which "
"animations play at GNOME's native speed. Touchpad-driven overview/workspace "
"opens already track your finger, so their wrap-up shouldn't be slowed. Set 0 "
"to disable the exception (ease everything, including gestures)."
msgstr ""
"触摸板手势（三指滑动/捏合）后的一段宽限时间，期间动画按 GNOME 原生速度播放。"
"触摸板驱动的概览/工作区打开本来就跟手，收尾不应被拖慢。设为 0 关闭该例外（包"
"括手势在内全部缓动）。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:103
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Easing curve (legacy)"
msgid "Enabled (legacy)"
msgstr "缓动曲线（旧版）"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:104
msgid ""
"Legacy key from earlier versions, no longer read. Pause the extension from "
"the Extensions manager instead."
msgstr ""

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:111
msgid "Continuity engine (legacy)"
msgstr "连续性引擎（旧版）"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:112
msgid ""
"Legacy key from the curve-library versions. The experimental spring "
"simulation engine was removed in v10; installs still on spring are moved "
"back to bridge at startup."
msgstr ""

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:117
msgid ""
"Route a close requested while the overview is still animating through the "
"gesture channel, so the drawer reverses immediately instead of finishing its "
"opening first. Turn off if overview open/close misbehaves."
msgstr ""
"动画进行中请求关闭时改走手势通道，抽屉立即反向收回，而不是先放完打开动画。若 "
"overview 开合行为异常请关闭。"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:121
msgid "Ease magic-lamp minimize/unminimize"
msgstr "缓动 magic-lamp 最小化/还原"

#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.nonlinear-animation.gschema.xml:122
msgid ""
"If compiz-alike-magic-lamp-effect is installed, curve its minimize/"
"unminimize timeline with EASE_OUT_CUBIC so the window decelerates into the "
"dock instead of stopping dead. No-op if magic-lamp isn't installed."
msgstr ""
"若安装了 compiz-alike-magic-lamp-effect，其最小化/还原时间线会改用 "
"EASE_OUT_CUBIC，窗口减速滑入 Dock 而不是急停。未安装则无任何影响。"
